  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nCurrently Homarr only shows containers in the local Docker instance. It would be great if Homarr could support adding additional multiple Docker environments, similar to Portainer Environments. \n\n### Additional information\n\nIdeally, I should be able to add additional environments in the GUI:\nhttps://home.mydomain.net/manage/tools/docker\n\nAlso add an option to override the default hostname for imports, see https://github.com/ajnart/homarr/issues/2245",
